  "2026-10-30T13:12:13.481Z","harness:claude-code","Duplicate check: a semantic search for execution_context and linked-test receipt verbosity, and a keyword search for execution_context. Closed pm-fqdmbf is the nearest owner. Its resolution records hoisting plus lean removal of successful streams only, and the live CLI shows execution_context in every variant, so this is a distinct, still-open boundary rather than a recurrence. Measured on this branch (feat/agent-same-command-corrections) in an isolated tracker."
